1
00:00:00,805 --> 00:00:03,175
(Bernadette:)Howie, I think you'd have fun.

2
00:00:06,378 --> 00:00:09,938
- Fine. You can tag along.
- Terrific.

3
00:00:10,148 --> 00:00:12,178
My two favorite fellas "gone fishing."

4
00:00:13,118 --> 00:00:16,888
(Howard:)Hang on a second.
Bernie, next weekend we have that thing.

5
00:00:17,088 --> 00:00:20,818
- What thing?
- You know, the thing.

6
00:00:21,626 --> 00:00:24,496
Oh, that thing. No, I canceled that thing.

7
00:00:26,498 --> 00:00:29,468
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)All right, it's settled.
You and I are going fishing.

8
00:00:29,668 --> 00:00:32,938
Great. Heh. Thanks for the help.

9
00:00:34,773 --> 00:00:37,833
(Howard:)I've never even been fishing.
This is gonna be a disaster.

10
00:00:38,043 --> 00:00:41,913
(Raj:)If you don't want to look foolish
doing something, you should practice.

11
00:00:42,113 --> 00:00:44,703
(Raj:)Do you know how many beef Wellingtons
I made by myself...

12
00:00:44,950 --> 00:00:46,780
(Raj:)...before I invited you guys over?

13
00:00:47,686 --> 00:00:54,026
(Raj:)I'll give you a hint.
You can see them here, here and here.

14
00:00:57,429 --> 00:01:00,329
Raj is right. You should get someone
to give you some pointers.

